flowchart TB
  NETWORK["FOUNDATION<br/>OpenWrt: routing, DNS, DHCP, firewall<br/>Tailscale / Headscale: private access"]:::source
  PLATFORM["COMPUTE AND SERVICE LIFECYCLE<br/>Proxmox VE → Debian guests<br/>Podman · Quadlet · systemd"]:::process
  DATA["STATE AND TRUST<br/>PostgreSQL · MariaDB · Valkey · SeaweedFS<br/>Caddy · Keycloak · SOPS / age"]:::process
  PLAN["DISCOVER AND PLAN<br/>SearXNG · SerpBear · Matomo<br/>OpenProject: brief, owner, decisions"]:::source
  CREATE["PRODUCE AND COORDINATE<br/>Activepieces + durable PostgreSQL state<br/>llama.cpp / OmniRoute · ComfyUI · speech<br/>FFmpeg · Pandoc · ResourceSpace"]:::process
  QA["VALIDATE THE EXACT REVISION<br/>Vale · Playwright · Lighthouse<br/>Evidence · asset rights · human review"]:::process
  GATE{"Revision, destination<br/>and channel authorized?"}:::gate
  WEB["WEB<br/>WordPress<br/>Pages and forms"]:::done
  SOCIAL["SOCIAL<br/>Postiz + Temporal<br/>Native scheduling"]:::done
  EMAIL["EMAIL<br/>Mautic + dispatch guard<br/>Managed SMTP"]:::done
  VOICE["VOICE<br/>Controller · Asterisk · Pipecat<br/>Separate phone eligibility"]:::done
  OTHER["OPTIONAL CHANNELS<br/>Commerce · ads · SMS<br/>Listings · events"]:::ext
  RECON["RECONCILE AND MEASURE<br/>Native destination IDs and authoritative outcomes<br/>Matomo · Mautic · SerpBear · provider metrics"]:::process
  REPORT["REVIEW AND IMPROVE<br/>PostgreSQL snapshots · Grafana<br/>New OpenProject brief → next approved iteration"]:::done
  HOLD["HOLD<br/>Repair, review or reconcile<br/>Never bypass final authorization"]:::hold
  OPS["CROSS-CUTTING OPERATIONS<br/>OTel · Prometheus · Loki · Trivy<br/>Disk / UPS health · bounded resources<br/>Coordinated backups · isolated restores"]:::control
  LEGACY["PRESERVED LEGACY SCOPE<br/>156 dispositions · 104 recovery records<br/>Migrate, isolate, hold or retire by owner decision<br/>V7 replaces the old planning reference, not evidence"]:::legacy
  NETWORK --> PLATFORM --> DATA --> PLAN --> CREATE --> QA --> GATE
  GATE -- "Web" --> WEB
  GATE -- "Social" --> SOCIAL
  GATE -- "Email: E11" --> EMAIL
  GATE -- "Voice: V02" --> VOICE
  GATE -- "Approved capability" --> OTHER
  GATE -- "No / unknown" --> HOLD
  WEB --> RECON
  SOCIAL --> RECON
  EMAIL --> RECON
  VOICE --> RECON
  OTHER --> RECON
  RECON --> REPORT
  OPS -. "operates and protects all layers" .-> DATA
  LEGACY -. "explicit scope and migration gates" .-> PLATFORM

